<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Stick Up</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Boston Manor</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Welcome to the Neighbourhood</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2cE3hAHAZrY6xQ0YRltenV</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.630" end="00:33.330">I feel alive but I'd rather be sane.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.330" end="00:35.670">They've got everything locked in a safe.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.670" end="00:38.280">I just want what's rightfully mine.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.280" end="00:46.170">I shouldn't have to beg you to survive.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.170" end="00:50.010">Just get out of my way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.010" end="00:53.730">Put your hands up this is a stick up.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.730" end="00:55.650" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Everyone on the ground)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.650" end="01:00.120">Put your hands up this is a stick up.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.120" end="01:02.820">If nobody moves, then nobody dies.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.820" end="01:06.120">I see the fear in your eyes.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.120" end="01:09.840">Put your hands up this is a stick up.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.840" end="01:17.840">&amp; I wouldn't wanna be you.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.030" end="01:23.610">How much time did you spend down in hell?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.610" end="01:26.370">Gave me a drink but they poisoned the well.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.370" end="01:28.710">I'm a mess &amp; I'm down on my knees.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.710" end="01:33.570">I'm getting sick of decay &amp; disease.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.570" end="01:35.070">Just get out of my way.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.560" end="01:38.670">Put your hands up this is a stick up.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.670" end="01:40.530" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Everyone on the ground)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.530" end="01:48.530">Put your hands up this is a stick up.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.610" end="01:53.370">If nobody moves, then nobody dies.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.370" end="01:56.640">I see the fear in your eyes.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.640" end="02:00.300">Put your hands up this is a stick up.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.300" end="02:01.800">&amp; I wouldn't wanna be you.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.810" end="02:08.810">Warm your freezing blood up against my skin.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.660" end="02:42.060">Warm your freezing blood up against my skin.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.060" end="02:43.560">Well you shouldn't be scared.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.020" end="02:51.020">Cause nobody would care.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.530" end="02:57.300">If I didn't wake up tomorrow.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.300" end="03:02.340">Well you shouldn't be scared cause nobody would care.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.340" end="03:05.610">Well you shouldn't be scared cause nobody would care</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.610" end="03:07.350">If I didn't wake up tomorrow.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.350" end="03:11.490">Well you shouldn't be scared.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.490" end="03:17.250">Put your hands up this is a stick up.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.250" end="03:18.750" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Everyone on the ground)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.790" end="03:21.600">Put your hands up this is a stick up.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:21.600" end="03:24.330">If nobody moves, then nobody dies.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:24.330" end="03:26.850">I see the fear in your eyes.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:26.850" end="03:31.320">Put your hands up this is a stick up.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:31.320" end="03:35.320">&amp; I wouldn't wanna be you.</p></div></body></tt>